  "Posted 26 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under STARTING (7): This Deal Is Getting Worse All The Time / Pray I Don't Alter It Any Further, Cloud City: Port Town District, Secret Plans, All Wrapped Up, Prepared Defenses, Combat Response, I'm Sorry; they count toward the 60. Prepared Defenses brings several Effects, so no single starting effect is set.",
  "Cloud City sites and Bespin dested the Dark pages: Bespin (Dark), Bespin: Cloud City (Dark), Cloud City: Carbonite Chamber (Dark), Cloud City: West Gallery (Dark); 'Cloud City Securtiy Tower' (typo) dested Cloud City: Security Tower.",
  "Posted 'Combat Responses' dested Combat Response; 'Uganaught x2' dested Ugnaught x2; 'Vibro-ax' dested the Dark page Vibro-Ax (Dark).",
